, sharding (splitting of a single table amongst multiple tablet servers for storage effectiveness), health-checking for tablet servers through heartbeat, recovery (handle the permanent loss of a tablet server) based on WAL (write-ahead log) and metadata, and start/kill the servers. The tablet servers support garbage collection (only keep the last five inserted values), maintaining the memtable for effective searching (memtable would spilled to disk when there are a hundred unique row keys exists), maintaining the in-memory indexes, sharding when a table contains more than 1000 row keys, WAL, reconstructing the tablet server state using WAL and SSTables maintained in the persistent storage, effective range searching in SSTables.","topics":[],"score":257006,"global_rank":53589,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10261},{"name":"SiqiD47/vision2019","owner":"SiqiD47","html_url":"https://github.com/SiqiD47/vision2019","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":256998,"global_rank":53596,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10262},{"name":"mukulhase/Youtube-To-GooglePlayMusic","owner":"mukulhase","html_url":"https://github.com/mukulhase/Youtube-To-GooglePlayMusic","stars":3,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":256997,"global_rank":53597,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10263},{"name":"jake-low/detect-lakes-in-dems","owner":"jake-low","html_url":"https://github.com/jake-low/detect-lakes-in-dems","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":256996,"global_rank":53599,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10264},{"name":"layertwo/vsplunk","owner":"layertwo","html_url":"https://github.com/layertwo/vsplunk","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Splunk app for VisiData","topics":["analysis","logs","security-tools","splunk",